# Kalman forward SHADOW bake-off cron template — DISABLED.
# Install only after bootstrap smoke passes and the historical source files are
# confirmed to refresh through the current session.
#
# CRON_TZ=Asia/Seoul
#
# Suggested daily cadence after the existing morning US/model refresh:
# 10 8 * * 2-6 root /bin/bash /opt/kalman/app/scripts/run_shadow_bakeoff_v1.sh >> /opt/kalman/logs/shadow-bakeoff-v1.log 2>&1
#
# The runner is file-only. It:
# - refuses to run while TRADING_ENABLED=true
# - refuses to run while LIVE_TRADING_CONFIRM is set
# - does not write Neon
# - does not create dashboard_snapshot rows
# - cannot submit Toss orders
#
# Required upstream data:
#   Market_Data/v2/raw/historical_2017/multimarket_raw_2017_present.parquet
#   Market_Features/v2/talib/historical_2017/multimarket_features_2017_present_v0_3.parquet
#   Market_Model_V2/historical_matrices_v1/*
#
# IMPORTANT:
# This cron should remain disabled until the historical integrated raw/features
# are confirmed to be refreshed automatically beyond the 2026-09-11 seed end.
